<cu-custom bgColor="bg-white" isBack="{{false}}" isTop="{{true}}">
  <view slot="content" class="nav-title text-black">观察箱</view>
</cu-custom>

<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-title">观察箱 · 给纠结一段冷静期</view>
    <view class="hero-sub">放进来 30 天，用实际使用回答「该不该留」</view>
  </view>

  <view class="item-card">
    <view class="li-head">
      <view>
        <view class="li-title">还没想好 {{overview.pending || 0}}</view>
        <view class="li-sub">冷静期中 {{overview.observing || 0}} · 想清楚了 {{overview.resolved || 0}} · 共 {{overview.total || 0}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="badge {{overview.due_count > 0 ? 'badge-warn' : 'badge-ok'}}">
        {{overview.due_count > 0 ? '到期 ' + overview.due_count : '没有到期'}}
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="li-actions"><view class="li-btn" bindtap="onRefresh">刷新</view></view>
  </view>

  <view class="loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">加载中...</view>
  <view class="item-card" wx:if="{{!loading && items.length === 0}}">
    <view class="q-title">观察箱空着</view>
    <view class="foot-note" style="text-align:left;margin:12rpx 0 24rpx;">
      说明你没有什么放不下的，挺好。想再想想时，在四问结果里选「再想想」就会出现在这里。
    </view>
    <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="onHome">去挑一件东西</button>
  </view>

  <view class="list-item" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="item_id">
    <view class="li-head">
      <view class="li-title">{{item.title}}</view>
      <view class="badge {{item.expired ? 'badge-warn' : ''}}">
        {{item.expired ? '已到期' : '还剩 ' + item.days_left + ' 天'}}
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="li-sub">冷静到 {{item.observe_until}} · 这期间用了 {{item.observe_used_count}} 次</view>
    <view class="li-actions">
      <view class="li-btn li-btn-main" data-id="{{item.item_id}}" bindtap="onUsed">这次用上了</view>
      <view class="li-btn" data-id="{{item.item_id}}" bindtap="onKeep">留下</view>
      <view class="li-btn" data-id="{{item.item_id}}" bindtap="onDispose">送它走</view>
      <view class="li-btn" data-id="{{item.item_id}}" bindtap="onVerdict">看分析</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
